                                                "sense_id": "c10446d5-eb65-3ea8-87c3-6f00aa68612b",
                                                "text": "Florence L. Harvey (1916-01), “Chilly Days and Muddy Courses”, in Golfers Magazine, volume 28, number 1, Chicago, page 9: “Do not think that is because I do not value a mashie, on the contrary it is my favorite club and one with which I am far surer than any other, in dry weather.”"
